        "title": "Capture a custom CPU profiling span",
        "description": "Capture a scoped span on each graphical application update using trace_chrome. Run in release mode with info-level spans enabled, then close the application normally and inspect the generated trace.",
        "code": "use bevy::prelude::*;\n\nfn main() {\n    App::new()\n        .add_plugins(DefaultPlugins)\n        .add_systems(Update, profile_work)\n        .run();\n}\n\nfn profile_work() {\n    let _span = info_span!(\"example_work\", name = \"example_work\").entered();\n    let total: u64 = (0..1_000_u64)\n        .map(std::hint::black_box)\n        .sum();\n    std::hint::black_box(total);\n}\n",
